          }
        },
        "about_quality_text_pursuit": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>High-quality raw down, raised in the rugged landscape of Spain, is carefully washed in Japan and refined into safe, high-quality down. To fully bring out the performance of this down, our factory carefully sews each product using designs that combine years of hands-on experience with data based on scientific research conducted in our lab.</p><p>From material development to final finishing, and through the aftercare we provide once a product reaches you, NANGA is always dedicated to the best possible craftsmanship.</p>"
          }
        },
        "about_quality_sub_washing": {
          "type": "subheading",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Commitment to Domestic Washing"
          }
        },
        "about_quality_text_washing": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>To bring out the full performance of down, it must be clean and free of impurities. Therefore, we entrust the washing of our down to Kawada Feather, a feather processing manufacturer with proprietary specialized equipment and superior technology. Taking advantage of the ultra-soft underground water nurtured by the rich environment surrounded by mountains and the climate of the Ise Plain in Mie Prefecture, which is ideal for drying feathers, high-quality down is produced.</p>"
          }
        },
        "about_quality_sub_artisans": {
          "type": "subheading",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Manufacturing by Skilled Artisans"
          }
        },
        "about_quality_text_artisans": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>Attention to detail in areas customers cannot see is NANGA's standard. From down filling and sewing to maintenance, because we have our own factory, we can carefully perform each process one by one, creating safe and secure products. By utilizing the skills of experienced craftsmen, product precision is enhanced, leading to the provision of items that satisfy our customers.</p>"
          }
        },
